# Voice-bot-companion environment variables
# Only GROQ_API_KEY is meaningfully required (for push-to-talk voice commands).
# Everything else has sensible defaults; uncomment to override.

# ── Push-to-talk voice commands (Groq Whisper STT) ─────────────────────────
# Reuse the same key as marvin-voice-core's .env. Without this, /audio returns
# 503 with a helpful message; everything else still works.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# ── Bridge connection to Marvin ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where companion-server connects to find Marvin's companion_bridge.
# Default: same machine, default port. Auto-reconnects every 5s.
# COMPANION_BRIDGE_URL=ws://localhost:8766/companion-ws

# Set to 1/true/yes to skip the real bridge and develop UI in isolation
# (BridgeClient reports is_connected=True, no actual WS to Marvin).
# COMPANION_BRIDGE_MOCK=

# ── Authentication ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Reuses MARMO_TOKEN from Marvin's .env. If Marvin's bridge sets MARMO_TOKEN,
# companion-server must present the same value as X-Marmo-Token header.
# Most personal setups leave this empty (Tailscale is the auth boundary).
# MARMO_TOKEN=
